sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Guest as Guest / Citizen
    participant UI as Public EcoBlog Page
    participant Ctrl as PublicBlogController
    participant Svc as BlogPostService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16

    Note over Guest,DB: G-01: Khach / Nguoi dan duyet bai viet da xuat ban, loc theo tag/tu khoa va doc theo slug (BR-ADM-08)

    Guest->>UI: Truy cap /blog (AllowAnonymous)
    UI->>Ctrl: GET /api/v1/blogs?search=...&tag=...&page=1&pageSize=12
    Ctrl->>Svc: ListPublishedAsync(search, tag, page, pageSize)
    Svc->>DB: Query blog_posts WHERE status = Approved AND published_at IS NOT NULL AND published_at <= NOW()
    opt Co tham so tag
        Svc->>DB: Loc khop nguyen the JSON %"tag"% (khong khop nham tien to)
    end
    Svc->>DB: OrderByDescending(published_at) + Skip/Take (pageSize max 50)
    Ctrl-->>UI: 200 OK BlogPagedResult~BlogPostSummaryDto~

    Guest->>UI: Chon mot bai viet de doc chi tiet
    UI->>Ctrl: GET /api/v1/blogs/{slug}
    Ctrl->>Svc: GetPublishedBySlugAsync(slug)
    Svc->>DB: FirstOrDefault(slug == normSlug AND status == Approved AND published_at <= NOW())
    alt Khong ton tai hoac bai van la Draft / Pending_Approval
        Svc-->>Ctrl: NotFoundException ("Khong tim thay bai viet")
        Ctrl-->>UI: 404 Not Found
    else Hop le va da xuat ban
        Ctrl-->>UI: 200 OK PublicBlogPostDto (khong ro ri rejectionReason hay trang thai noi bo)
    end
